 "cells": [
  {
   "id": "crush-control-flow-md-1",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "# Control Flow\n\nCrush has `if`/`else`, `while`, `for`, `break`/`continue`, a `match` expression,\nand `try`/`catch`/`throw`. Conditions are type-checked and must be `Bool`.\n\n## If\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "id": "crush-control-flow-1",
   "kind": {
    "type": "crush"
   },
   "source": "let score = 85\n\nif score >= 90 {\n    print(\"A\")\n} else if score >= 80 {\n    print(\"B\")\n} else {\n    print(\"C or below\")\n}\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "pending"
   },
   "meta": {
    "tags": [
     "guide",
     "runnable"
    ],
    "extra": {
     "guide": {
      "src": "crush/control_flow.md:8",
      "browser": "run",
      "expect_output": "B\n"
     }
    }
   },
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "id": "crush-control-flow-md-3",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "`if` is a statement, not an expression: `let y = if c { 1 } else { 2 }` is a\nparse error. Use a function or `match` to select a value.\n\n## While\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "id": "crush-control-flow-2",
   "kind": {
    "type": "crush"
   },
   "source": "let i = 0\nwhile i < 3 {\n    print(i)\n    i = i + 1\n}\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "pending"
   },
   "meta": {
    "tags": [
     "guide",
     "runnable"
    ],
    "extra": {
     "guide": {
      "src": "crush/control_flow.md:30",
      "browser": "run",
      "expect_output": "0\n1\n2\n"
     }
    }
   },
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "id": "crush-control-flow-md-5",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "### Loop with `break`\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "id": "crush-control-flow-3",
   "kind": {
    "type": "crush"
   },
   "source": "let counter = 0\nwhile true {\n    if counter >= 3 {\n        break\n    }\n    counter = counter + 1\n}\nprint(counter)\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "pending"
   },
   "meta": {
    "tags": [
     "guide",
     "runnable"
    ],
    "extra": {
     "guide": {
