     }
    }
   },
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "id": "crush-control-flow-md-26",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "## Next Steps\n\n- **[Functions](https://docs.crushlang.org/crush/functions.html)**\n- **[Capability System](https://docs.crushlang.org/crush/capabilities.html)**\n",
